d amounts.","Gross weight","Weight of goods including packing but excluding carrier's equipment.","Net volume","Measure of the gross volume of the item, excluding unoccupied volume of the packaging.","Origin","Details related to the origin of the goods.","Country of origin code","Code specifying the country in which the goods have been produced or manufactured, according to criteria laid down for the application of the Customs tariff or quantitative restrictions, or any measure related to trade.","CountryCodeList","Packaging","Details related to packaging.","Shipping marks","Marks and or numbers on a transport unit or package.","UN/ECE Recommendation 15","Number of packages","Quantity specifying the number of individual items packaged in such a way that they cannot be divided without first undoing the packing.","Type of packages identification code","Code specifying the type of package of an item.","PackageTypeCodeList","Packing material description","Description of the type of material for packaging covered by UN/Recommendation 21.","Package dimension length","Length of the package.","Package dimension width","Width of the package.","Package dimension height","Height of the package.","Package volume","Volume of the package.","Package dimension diameter","Diameter of the package.","TransportEquipment","Details related to transport equipment used for the consignment.","Seal","Details related to the seal affixed to a piece of transport equipment, used to secure an object and protect from unauthorized entry or tampering.","Seal identifier","Identification of a seal affixed to a piece of transport equipment by number.","GoodsLocation","Details related to the location of the goods.","Goods location name","Name of the location where goods are located.","Goods location identifier","Identification of  the location of goods.","GovernmentProcedure","Details related to the current and previous government procedure.","Government procedure code","Code specifying a procedure.","U